<td>复购率、社群活跃、UGC 量、自发辩护行为</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p><strong>B. Sharp &amp; Romaniuk 实证指标</strong>（《How Brands Grow》《Distinctive Brand Assets》）：</p>
<table>
